"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">whatever, i'll take it. i was hoping that we would get a &amp;quot;rites of spring&amp;quot; type of book, with more fairy magic and subsystems and merits. but i guess a kith book is cool. like, i'm not super into character creation as a mini-game so all that front end option stuff sorta leaves me a cold.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think The Hedge will have alot of that kind of stuff in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T11:42:31-07:00","id":1131365,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing Kiths and Kin being the size of The Pack as opposed to The Hedge which I see being more along the lines of the up coming Signs of Sorcery. <br /> <br /> I can also see Kiths and Kin being a stretch goal, along with ready made characters (honestly RMCs don't interest me, but it was mentioned).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T11:51:42-07:00","id":1131370,"title":"","content":"I would love if the &quot;kin&quot; part of this is where we sneak in playable Fetches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reacti